      "english": "Becoming a Monk and Leaving Home"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小雨：本，早啊！你今天来得真早！",
      "traditional": "小雨：本，早啊！你今天來得真早！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ běn zǎo a nǐ jīn tiān lái de zhēn zǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Ben, good morning! You arrived really early today!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：早上车太多，我七点就出家了。",
      "traditional": "本：早上車太多，我七點就出家了。",
      "pinyin": "běn zǎo shang chē tài duō wǒ qī diǎn jiù chū jiā le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: There are too many cars in the morning. I became a monk at 7 o’clock."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小雨：出？家？你是想说“出门”吗？",
      "traditional": "小雨：出？家？你是想說“出門”嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ chū jiā nǐ shì xiǎng shuō chū mén ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Became a monk? Did you want to say “left home”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：对，出门！我七点就出门了。",
      "traditional": "本：對，出門！我七點就出門了。",
      "pinyin": "běn duì chū mén wǒ qī diǎn jiù chū mén le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: That’s right, left home! I left home at 7 o’clock."
    }
  ],
